{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261020/photo/bkn-20261020174117791-1020_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261020233328\"/><p>港府今日(20日)對法國發出黃色外遊警示，指當地示威活動持續，造成暴力衝突及破壞呼籲計劃前赴或已在法國的港人應留意局勢，提高警惕，注意安全，並留意當地就最新情況的公布，避開人群聚集的地方。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T15:41:48.459069+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:41:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:29.637688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T15:38:08.437581+00:00","content_hash":"957f125b0d3e424a1114808911900993aa15878939122212df048df2c9c4dda2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}